      "translation": "설정",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Add the `wasm32-wasip2` target to the Rust toolchain.",
      "source_hash": 9498541282177228515,
      "context_hash": 12250338447330865028,
      "translation": "Rust 툴체인에 `wasm32-wasip2` 타깃을 추가하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Install [`wasmtime`][wasmtime].",
      "source_hash": 11702867561804686972,
      "context_hash": 17958615611121832241,
      "translation": "[`wasmtime`][wasmtime]을 설치하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "The Wasmtime CLI has a built-in HTTP server that supports serving WebAssembly HTTP components.",
      "source_hash": 7136170623280904010,
      "context_hash": 15513837577175828940,
      "translation": "Wasmtime CLI에는 WebAssembly HTTP 컴포넌트를 제공할 수 있는 내장 HTTP 서버가 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "2.",
      "source_hash": 1210270714770233551,
      "context_hash": 5902324223410238633,
      "translation": "2.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:1",
      "source": "Creating a Rust WebAssembly project",
      "source_hash": 7439576677140534903,
      "context_hash": 11984439721581448540,
      "translation": "Rust WebAssembly 프로젝트 생성하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Create a new Rust project with `cargo new`:",
      "source_hash": 1451078617169536001,
      "context_hash": 8684993306821760634,
      "translation": "`cargo new`로 새 Rust 프로젝트를 생성하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583850Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Add [`wstd`][wstd], a Rust async standard library for Wasm components as a dependency with `cargo add`:",
      "source_hash": 7581385717398106144,
      "context_hash": 2766256052448244774,
      "translation": "`cargo add`를 사용하여 Wasm 컴포넌트를 위한 Rust 비동기 표준 라이브러리인 [`wstd`][wstd]를 의존성으로 추가하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583851Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "`wstd` provides idiomatic Rust bindings for WASI standard interfaces [(`wasi:http`)](https://github.com/WebAssembly/WASI/tree/main/proposals/http) to increase ease-of-use for Rust WebAssembly components.",
      "source_hash": 4487649500576383908,
      "context_hash": 3563982389653316146,
      "translation": "`wstd`는 Rust WebAssembly 컴포넌트의 사용 편의성을 높이기 위해 WASI 표준 인터페이스 [(`wasi:http`)](https://github.com/WebAssembly/WASI/tree/main/proposals/http)에 대한 관용적인 Rust 바인딩을 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583851Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "Since we are using `wstd`, we will not need to add WIT files or depend on [`wit-bindgen`](https://docs.rs/wit-bindgen) directly.",
      "source_hash": 799666878777720688,
      "context_hash": 399357133919082781,
      "translation": "`wstd`를 사용하므로 WIT 파일을 추가하거나 [`wit-bindgen`](https://docs.rs/wit-bindgen)에 직접 의존할 필요가 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583851Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "[!NOTE]",
      "source_hash": 11826018300025404409,
      "context_hash": 5770609293473004815,
      "translation": "[!NOTE]",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583851Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "It is possible to build an HTTP component in Rust without `wstd`.",
      "source_hash": 5410612537608761182,
      "context_hash": 8308839351864350088,
      "translation": "`wstd` 없이도 Rust로 HTTP 컴포넌트를 빌드하는 것이 가능합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583851Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:1",
      "source": "Building a HTTP component without `wstd` would require defining the [`wasi:http`](https://github.com/WebAssembly/WASI/tree/main/proposals/http) imports/exports of the component in WIT, fetching  WIT dependencies with `wkg` and generating the Rust bindings with `wit-bindgen`.",
      "source_hash": 11038980168941623746,
      "context_hash": 8264276541250350677,
      "translation": "`wstd` 없이 HTTP 컴포넌트를 빌드하려면 컴포넌트의 [`wasi:http`](https://github.com/WebAssembly/WASI/tree/main/proposals/http) 임포트/익스포트를 WIT로 정의하고, `wkg`로 WIT 의존성을 가져오고, `wit-bindgen`으로 Rust 바인딩을 생성해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583851Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Both approaches are valid, but `wstd` offers superior developer experience, so we opt to use it here.",
      "source_hash": 1843860314738621782,
      "context_hash": 14906238487181295849,
      "translation": "두 접근 방식 모두 유효하지만, `wstd`가 더 우수한 개발자 경험을 제공하므로 여기서는 이를 사용하기로 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583851Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "`wstd` and `wit-bindgen` are not mutually exclusive and can co-exist in the same project.",
      "source_hash": 155360365910569965,
      "context_hash": 204106314625932022,
      "translation": "`wstd`와 `wit-bindgen`은 상호 배타적이지 않으며 같은 프로젝트에서 공존할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583851Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "3.",
      "source_hash": 414013015342266677,
      "context_hash": 9702603760196495985,
      "translation": "3.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583851Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:1",
      "source": "Writing the HTTP handler",
      "source_hash": 3947850639736052204,
      "context_hash": 7807987612867609848,
      "translation": "HTTP 핸들러 작성하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583851Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "We will implement the HTTP handler in `src/main.rs`.",
      "source_hash": 16476962264788740430,
      "context_hash": 15319513064470708069,
      "translation": "`src/main.rs`에 HTTP 핸들러를 구현할 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583851Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "The file should look like the following:",
      "source_hash": 15202482827234656454,
      "context_hash": 4565618152032389665,
      "translation": "파일은 다음과 같은 모습이어야 합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583851Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "4.",
      "source_hash": 14789025571905875223,
      "context_hash": 10654163868920318810,
      "translation": "4.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583852Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:1",
      "source": "Compiling and running the component",
      "source_hash": 15059421184873884884,
      "context_hash": 3957455879136593348,
      "translation": "컴포넌트 컴파일 및 실행하기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583852Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Build the component:",
      "source_hash": 10142519929139787882,
      "context_hash": 9666990362090394869,
      "translation": "컴포넌트를 빌드하십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583852Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The `.wasm` binary for the component can be found at `target/wasm32-wasip2/release/wasm-http-hello-world.wasm`.",
      "source_hash": 7770828116354254740,
      "context_hash": 17700360215008473964,
      "translation": "컴포넌트의 `.wasm` 바이너리는 `target/wasm32-wasip2/release/wasm-http-hello-world.wasm`에서 찾을 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583852Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "To run the component, we can use [`wasmtime`](https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/), a reference implementation host that supports the Component Model.",
      "source_hash": 7358316505307412516,
      "context_hash": 15111640869978878349,
      "translation": "컴포넌트를 실행하려면 컴포넌트 모델을 지원하는 참조 구현 호스트인 [`wasmtime`](https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/)을 사용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component model": "컴포넌트 모델",
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583852Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "In particular, we can use `wasmtime serve` subcommand, which will spin-up an HTTP server at `http://localhost:8080` which will use our component to fulfill web requests. `wasmtime` creates a *fresh* instance of the component every time a request is served.",
      "source_hash": 2993204406351208831,
      "context_hash": 9363851550954339458,
      "translation": "특히, `wasmtime serve` 하위 명령을 사용할 수 있는데, 이는 `http://localhost:8080`에서 HTTP 서버를 구동하여 우리의 컴포넌트를 사용해 웹 요청을 처리합니다. `wasmtime`은 요청이 처리될 때마다 컴포넌트의 *새로운* 인스턴스를 생성합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583852Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "You can test it with `curl -i localhost:8080`",
      "source_hash": 5384520204887790477,
      "context_hash": 3856944692459259361,
      "translation": "`curl -i localhost:8080`으로 테스트해볼 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583852Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "With this, we have successfully built and run a basic WebAssembly HTTP component with Rust 🎉",
      "source_hash": 17732851466883445395,
      "context_hash": 3186575560996097217,
      "translation": "이로써 Rust로 기본적인 WebAssembly HTTP 컴포넌트를 성공적으로 빌드하고 실행했습니다 🎉",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:48:47.583853Z",
      "issues": []
    },
